# S CI/CD — all platforms

## Workflows

### `.github/workflows/ci.yml`
| Job | OS | What |
|-----|-----|------|
| test | Ubuntu, macOS, Windows | doctor, tests, smoke, html build |
| native-linux | Ubuntu | cargo build s_fast + artifact |
| native-macos | macOS | cargo build s_fast + artifact |
| native-windows | Windows | cargo build s_fast.exe + artifact |
| package | Ubuntu | portable zip artifact |
| release | on tag `v*` | attach all artifacts to GitHub Release |

### `.github/workflows/pages.yml`
Deploys `website/` to GitHub Pages on main push.

## Tag a release
```bash
git tag v3.8.1
git push origin v3.8.1
```

## Local parity
```bash
python3 s test
bash build.sh
```
